values ('bau', 'جامعة البلقاء التطبيقية', 'Al-Balqa Applied University', 'السلط', 'public', array['bau.edu.jo']::text[], 32.0249589, 35.7167936, 'draft', 'Majors = every row of BAU''s official ''التخصصات ورسوم الساعات المعتمدة التفصيلية لكافة البرامج للعام الجامعي 2027/2026 (البكالوريوس والبكالوريوس التقني) – المسارات الأكاديمية'' (ba2026-2027.pdf). Covers all colleges, not only Salt: the first 12 colleges are on the Salt main campus; the rest are BAU university colleges elsewhere (campus in name_en). Filter on that if only Salt is wanted. PDF text extraction broke lam-alef ligatures (e.g. ''االنشاءات'', ''عبدهللا''); these were normalised to standard spelling (الإنشاءات، عبدالله). Hamza placement may differ slightly from the printed PDF. Programmes marked موقوف (suspended for new admission 2026/2027) are still included because current students may be enrolled: ICT – علم الحاسوب; AI – الواقع الافتراضي وصناعة الألعاب; Agri – وقاية النبات; Princess Alia – إدارة المكتبات والمعلومات; Huson – المحاسبة، الهندسة الكهربائية/ أنظمة وأمن الشبكات، علم الحاسوب، علم الحاسوب/ إنترنت الأشياء; Ajloun – علم الحاسوب; Aqaba – اللوجستيات وإدارة التوريد; Civil Protection Academy – الهندسة الميكانيكية/ الطاقة المتجددة. Technical bachelor (بكالوريوس تقني) programmes are marked in name_en and kept as degree ''bachelor''. Table layout was partly garbled: an English pass of the same PDF also placed ''الإرشاد النفسي والتربوي'' and ''علم الاجتماع/ الانحراف والجريمة'' under Ajloun University College, and did not show Nutrition / AC-technology under Huson – college assignment for these few rows is uncertain. College Arabic names follow the registration PDF; the homepage menu calls some differently: ''السلط للعلوم التربوية والإنسانية'', ''عمان الجامعية للعلوم المالية والادارية'', ''جرش الجامعية التقنية'' (diploma only, no bachelor rows), AI faculty page header ''كلية الذكاء الإصطناعي'' (PDF header garbled as ''كلية الذكاء أمن المعلومات والفضاء الالكتروني''). English names are translations, not official. Community-college/intermediate diplomas left out: the official diploma PDFs (d2025-2026-a.pdf, Da2026-2027.pdf) extract as garbled Arabic, so there is no clean list. Vocational-track bachelor list (bam2026-2027.pdf) and old-branch list not separately parsed. Email: only office addresses @bau.edu.jo (info@, reg@) confirmed; student Microsoft 365 address format/subdomain NOT verified (official NewEMail.aspx page failed to load). E-learning: the official student Moodle guide says each college has its own Moodle reached via the homepage (Student Services > E-learning); no single stable URL confirmed, so none listed. Reg.aspx (e-registration) is linked from the registration unit page but failed to load during verification. Centre coordinates from Wikipedia infobox (32.0240, 35.7168), not cross-checked on OSM. Wikipedia lists colours as olive green and khaki but gives no hex value, so brand_color is null. admhec.gov.jo could not be read (robots-disallowed). BUILDINGS: empty list on purpose. OpenStreetMap could not be queried from this session (Nov 2026): overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and the OSM API were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy, and OSM element pages found via search show no coordinates for ways. No building coordinates were guessed. Campus center was NOT re-checked against OSM for the same reason (kept from the draft source named above).')
