values ('gju', 'الجامعة الألمانية الأردنية', 'German Jordanian University', 'مادبا', 'public', array['gju.edu.jo']::text[], 31.776843, 35.802555, 'draft', 'Colleges and majors are verbatim from the official Arabic ''بَرامِج البكالوريوس'' page (English names from the matching English page). The Arabic page spells the design programme ''فِسْم التَّصميم والتّواصُل البصريّ'' (a typo of ''قسم''); it is written here as ''التَّصميم والتّواصُل البصريّ''. The 2026/2027 ''Available Bachelor''s Programs'' PDF (English only) differs: it no longer lists Sustainable Infrastructure Systems Engineering, folds Interior Architecture into Architecture as a track, lists Game Design and Media Informatics as a joint SC/SABE programme, and adds a new ''Cultural and Natural Heritage'' bachelor (SAHSS) whose Arabic name was not found, so it is omitted. Tracks (e.g. CS: Cyber Security / Data Science) are not listed as separate majors. Email: Office 365 tenant and OWA URL use gju.edu.jo (info@gju.edu.jo); no separate student subdomain was found, but the student address format was not verified. The ''teams'' link is the official Office 365 sign-in (no direct Teams link on the site). Main campus is on Amman–Madaba Street (P.O. Box Amman 11180, campus in Mushaqar/Madaba governorate); coordinates from the official contact page''s Google Maps link. Brand colour not verified. UPDATE Nov 2026: the official 2026/2027 ''Available Bachelor''s Programs'' PDF (re-read) lists ''Cultural and Natural Heritage'' under SAHSS, so it has been added. Its Arabic name ''التراث الثقافي والطبيعي'' is a translation and has not been verified (flag name_ar_translated). ''Sustainable Infrastructure Systems Engineering'' and the separate ''Interior Architecture'' major are kept, because there is no evidence they were closed and current students may be enrolled, but they are not offered for 2026/2027 new admission. Tracks on the 2026/2027 list: Mechatronics (Applied AI; Robotics & Autonomous Systems), Mechanical & Maintenance (Automotive & E-Mobility; Thermal Systems), Biomedical (Instrumentation; Bionic & Biomechanical), CS (Cyber Security; Data Science), CE (AI & ML; Computer Vision & Robotics), Energy (Renewable; Electrical Power), EE (5G & IoT), Intl Accounting (Forensic & Fraud Examination), Translation (Applied; AI in Translation). Hosted THWS programmes (Campus-Gate / Online-Gate) are not listed. ''Health Informatics'' (SAMS, in a 2022/23 admission notice) is not on the current lists and is not included. BUILDINGS: empty list on purpose. OpenStreetMap could not be queried from this session (Nov 2026): overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and the OSM API were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy, and OSM element pages found via search show no coordinates for ways. No building coordinates were guessed. Campus center was NOT re-checked against OSM for the same reason (kept from the draft source named above).')
