values ('hu', 'الجامعة الهاشمية', 'The Hashemite University', 'الزرقاء', 'public', array['hu.edu.jo']::text[], 32.1035, 36.1865, 'draft', 'RE-CHECK (2026-11-03): The bachelor list was re-verified against three official HU sources and they agree: the 2026/27 regular+parallel fee schedule (''The programs and the fees in JD _2027''), the international-programme fee schedule for students admitted from 2024/25, and the 29-09-2026 parallel direct-admission announcement (newsid 37977, 32 of the majors with Arabic names). Result: 15 undergraduate-teaching faculties / 58 bachelor programmes; no programme newer than this was found on HU pages or in the news (the 2021 ''new majors'' news covered Cyber Security, Data Science & AI, Digital Marketing, all already included). The HU homepage lists 17 colleges: the 15 here plus ''كلية الدراسات العليا'' (graduate only, omitted) and ''الكلية التقنية'' (unitid 75000000). The Technical College is now INCLUDED with an empty majors list: it is an official HU college, but its page is an unfilled template (its department links show the Physical & Occupational Therapy department text) and no diploma/technical programme for it was found on any HU page or fee schedule; HU''s only ''diploma'' fee sheet is the graduate Professional Diploma. If the app should not show colleges without majors, drop it. Not added: ''البكالوريوس المتداخل في العلوم الطبية الأساسية'' (Medicine) and ''العلوم الهندسية المساندة'' (Engineering), which appear on a secondary site (dirasaabroad) but are not admission programmes in HU''s fee schedules. The international fee sheet omits ''التربية البدنية وعلوم الرياضة'' (kept, it is in the regular 2027 sheet). CENTER: still null - HU''s own site, Wikipedia (en/ar), Wikidata search results and uniRank give no coordinates, and OSM was unreachable (see below); campus is on the Amman-Mafraq highway ~25 km NE of Amman next to the Zarqa Free Zone. Fill from OSM. HU publishes a facilities guide (tel.hu.edu.jo/Home/BuildingInfo: internet & exam labs, cafeteria, men''s/women''s prayer rooms, parking, sports facilities) but with no coordinates. BUILDINGS: empty. OpenStreetMap could not be reached from this session: overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and openstreetmap.org were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy (also from the device shell), the Chrome extension was not connected, and OSM mirrors (mapcarta) returned errors. No coordinates were guessed. Re-run the Overpass query from an unrestricted machine to fill buildings. PREVIOUS NOTES: Programme list = the 58 bachelor programmes in HU''s official English fee schedule ''The programs and the fees in JD _2027'' (Finance unit page, unitid=42000000); English names come from it. The Arabic version of that PDF could not be fetched (URL too long for the tool), so Arabic names were taken from other official HU pages: parallel-programme announcements (newsid 37977, 37597), new-majors news (33663), the 2021-2024 strategic plan PDF, and the major column of an official HU admitted-students list. Arabic spellings are kept as HU writes them, including missing hamzas (e.g. ''ادارة اعمال'', ''اللغة العربية وادابها''). PDF-extraction artefacts were fixed in ''التصوير الطبي والاشعاعي'', ''التغذية السريرية والحميات'' and ''هندسة البرمجيات'', and a typo in ''ادراة الموارد التراثية والمتاحف'' was corrected to ''ادارة''. NOT VERIFIED in Arabic on an official page: ''التكنولوجيا المالية'' (Financial Technology), ''الموارد الطبيعية في الأراضي الجافة'' (Dry Lands Natural Resources; a HU news item only calls it ''الموارد الطبيعية''), and the programme ''التربية البدنية وعلوم الرياضة'' (copied from the faculty name). Nursing is offered as ''علم التمريض'' with separate male and female sections. HU also lists Psychological Counseling under the Faculty of Educational Sciences. Left out: the Technical College (الكلية التقنية), because no bachelor or diploma programmes were found listed for it, and the Faculty of Graduate Studies. Email: the staff webmail link is Google Workspace for hu.edu.jo, and the site links students to Office 365 (mail.office365.com). No official page confirming the student address domain was found, so a student subdomain such as std.hu.edu.jo is unverified and not included. Center: no coordinates were found on the university site, Wikipedia or Wikidata, so center is null. It needs to be filled from OpenStreetMap (the campus is roughly 25 km northeast of Amman, near Zarqa). brand_color is null: Wikipedia lists the colours as orange and red, but no official hex value was found. The academic calendar link points to the page HU labels as the calendar. HU also has a calendar archive at hu.edu.jo/unitcenter/CalArchive.aspx?unitid=40000000.')
