values ('just', 'جامعة العلوم والتكنولوجيا الأردنية', 'Jordan University of Science and Technology', 'إربد', 'public', array['just.edu.jo']::text[], 32.4949956, 35.9911707, 'draft', 'POPULATED FROM SECONDARY SOURCES (2026-11-03) - every just.edu.jo / services.just.edu.jo URL still returns the WAF page ''Request Rejected'' to the fetcher, and mohe.gov.jo / admhec.gov.jo lists are robots-disallowed. Colleges and Arabic programme names come from dirasaabroad.com''s JUST page (11 undergraduate faculties, programme names in Arabic), cross-checked against Wikipedia''s faculty list and mawdoo3''s 2021/22 admission table (45 programmes, all of which are included here). Programmes newer than mawdoo3''s list are corroborated by the TITLES/URLs of official just.edu.jo documents seen in search results (content not readable): Robotics study plan Oct-2025, IoT study plan Oct-2025, Computer Games (''CG'') study plan Oct-2025, Digital Agriculture department page, Product Design & Development Engineering study plan, Midwifery study plans, Urban Planning programmes page. NOT independently corroborated on an official URL: ''نظم المعلومات الصحية'', ''التصنيع الدوائي والبيولوجي'', ''الكيمياء التطبيقية'', ''التغذية السريرية'' (Agriculture), ''تكنولوجيا صيانة الطائرات'', ''تخطيط وتصميم المدن'' vs ''هندسة التخطيط الحضري والبيئي'' (may be old/new names of the same programme), ''الإدارة والسياسات الصحية'' (dirasaabroad puts it in Medicine, mawdoo3 lists it among AMS programmes). Arabic names drop the source''s ''البكالوريوس في'' prefix. English names are translations, not official. Choices: Electrical Engineering kept as one programme (dirasaabroad also lists ''communications'' and ''power'' tracks); Veterinary kept as ''دكتور في الطب البيطري'' (dirasaabroad also lists the older name ''الطب والجراحة البيطرية''); Pharmacy (B.Sc.) and PharmD kept as separate programmes; nursing is admitted as male/female sections and midwifery is female-only (mawdoo3). Omitted: ''البكالوريوس المتداخل في العلوم الطبية الأساسية'' and its 7 tracks (embedded degree inside MD, not an admission programme), the Nanotechnology Institute and Faculty of Graduate Studies (graduate only), and Wikipedia''s ''forensic science'' mention (no Arabic programme found). No JUST diploma programmes found. Center 32.47889, 35.985 = Wikipedia infobox (32°28′44″N 35°59′6″E), not OSM-verified. email_domains: just.edu.jo; student subdomain not verified. BUILDINGS: empty. OpenStreetMap could not be reached from this session: overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and openstreetmap.org were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy (also from the device shell), the Chrome extension was not connected, and OSM mirrors (mapcarta) returned errors. No coordinates were guessed. Re-run the Overpass query from an unrestricted machine to fill buildings. ')
