values ('ttu', 'جامعة الطفيلة التقنية', 'Tafila Technical University', 'الطفيلة', 'public', array['ttu.edu.jo','stu.ttu.edu.jo']::text[], 30.8410004, 35.6429256, 'draft', 'Bachelor majors are verbatim from the official tuition-fees page (Admission & Registration dept), which may still list programmes that are closed to new admission (e.g. ''العلوم الاساسية'', ''التربية'', and both ''هندسة الميكاترونيكس'' and ''هندسة الميكاترونيكس والروبوتات''). The academics page states counts of 16 engineering / 9 science / 6 education / 7 business / 2 arts / 4 IT bachelor programmes (44 total, though the same page also says 33 bachelor programmes overall). The English engineering page also lists ''Electrical Power & Control Engineering'' and ''Air Conditioning and Refrigeration Technology'', whose Arabic names were not found, so they are omitted. Diplomas: only the 6 intermediate-diploma specialisations shown on the academics page under ''الكلية التقنية المتوسطة'' are included; the fee page lists ~40 diploma names (many likely historical) and the site says 13 intermediate-diploma specialisations exist. Email: students use [StudentID]@stu.ttu.edu.jo (stated on the student-services page); staff domain ttu.edu.jo. The Teams link on the site is a long login.microsoftonline.com OAuth URL redirecting to teams.microsoft.com/v2, simplified here. Campus centre coordinates could not be verified (campus is in Al-Eis district on the hills overlooking Tafila, ~1251 m altitude), so lat/lng are null. Brand colour not verified. English names for engineering majors are from the official English page; others are translations. 2026-11-03 re-check against the official Arabic college pages (ttu.edu.jo/academics/college-of-*): Engineering lists 17 bachelor programmes; added ''هندسة القوى الكهربائية والتحكم'' and ''تكنولوجيا التكييف والتبريد'' (Arabic names now verified). Science page lists 7 bachelors (no ''العلوم الاساسية'' or ''الكيمياء التطبيقية'' - kept from the fee page but likely closed/legacy). Education page lists only ''التربية الخاصة'' and ''معلم صف / اللغة الانجليزية'' as bachelors while stating 6; ''صعوبات التعلم'' appears there as an intermediate diploma (kept both levels). Business page lists 5 bachelors (FinTech written ''التكنولوجيا المالي (FinTech)''); ''الاقتصاد'' and ''إدارة سلاسل التزويد واللوجيستيات الرقمية'' are from the fee page only. IT page names the AI major ''الذكاء الاصطناعي وعلم البيانات''. Added college-level intermediate diplomas exactly as listed on the college pages (Engineering 3 - wording such as ''هندسة الاتصالات'' as a diploma is verbatim, Science 1, Education 3, Business 1, IT 2); together with the 6 under الكلية التقنية that is 16 vs the stated 13, so some may be legacy. English diploma names are translations. Centre coordinates still null: Wikipedia and unirank give no coordinates and OSM/Nominatim was unreachable; campus is on the Al-Eis hills above Tafila (PO Box 179, Tafila 66110). BUILDINGS/COORDINATES (2026-11-03 pass): OpenStreetMap data could not be queried from this environment - nominatim.openstreetmap.org, overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems and api/www.openstreetmap.org were all refused by the session''s egress allowlist (WebFetch and shell), and OSM way pages reachable via search results do not expose coordinates. No building coordinates were guessed, so ''buildings'' is an empty list; re-run the Overpass query from an environment with OSM access.')
