values ('yu', 'جامعة اليرموك', 'Yarmouk University', 'إربد', 'public', array['yu.edu.jo','ses.yu.edu.jo']::text[], 32.5351791, 35.8566931, 'draft', 'RE-CHECK (2026-11-03): colleges/majors unchanged from the draft (official 2026/27 admission list, 16 faculties / 79 bachelor programmes). Center 32.535930, 35.859444 is the centre of YU''s own official Google My Map (linked from yu.edu.jo/index.php/en/yu-maps; the same map is also opened at 32.536364, 35.858315) - kept. That official My Map (mid=1TnQLkOhx-5xz5qOKmdtij8qOm0eCGPGy) very likely holds building placemarks, but its KML/viewer could not be fetched here (allowlist). BUILDINGS: empty. OpenStreetMap could not be reached from this session: overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and openstreetmap.org were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy (also from the device shell), the Chrome extension was not connected, and OSM mirrors (mapcarta) returned errors. No coordinates were guessed. Re-run the Overpass query from an unrestricted machine to fill buildings. PREVIOUS NOTES: The programme list (79 bachelor programmes) and the Arabic names come from YU Admission & Registration''s official ''التخصصات المتاحة لدرجة البكالوريوس 2026/2027'' (admreg.yu.edu.jo/images/docs/majors.pdf). In the extracted PDF text, programmes are not explicitly tied to faculty cells. The faculty grouping was inferred from list order and subject, and most programmes are unambiguous. UNCERTAIN: ''علم النفس الاكلينيكي'' (Clinical Psychology) appears between Pharmacy and Nursing. It is placed under the Faculty of Medicine here, but its faculty was not confirmed. The placements of ''التربية الفنية'' and ''الفنون الرقمية'' (Fine Arts), ''الواقع الرقمي وتطوير الألعاب'' (IT) and ''اللغة الفرنسية التطبيقية'' (Arts) are also inferred from position. The names ''دكتور في الطب'' and ''هندسة العمارة'' are marked ''(قبول سنوي)'' (annual intake) in the source. Fine Arts admission requires an aptitude exam, and Physical Education requires a medical exam. English programme names are translations: no current official English programme list was found, since majorsEn.pdf is an older 2021/2022 Arabic list. English faculty names come from yu.edu.jo/index.php/en/faculties. Faculty Arabic names follow the YU homepage, which writes ''كلية الاعمال'', ''كلية الاعلام'' and ''كلية الشريعة والدراسات الاسلامية'' without hamza. The homepage writes the IT faculty without ''كلية'' and with ''علوم الحاسوب''; the 2026/27 list writes ''علم الحاسوب''. Left out: the Technical College (الكلية التقنية), which appears on the homepage but has no programmes in the bachelor list, and no diploma programmes were found listed; also graduate studies. Email: students use @ses.yu.edu.jo (official YU page on the student email account) and staff use @yu.edu.jo. YU moved student and staff email from Gmail to Microsoft 365 on 29-12-2022 (official announcement), and the homepage email link is outlook.com/yu.edu.jo. The older ses.yu.edu.jo help page still mentions Gmail login, which is outdated. Microsoft Teams: no official link was found, so none is included. Center: map-centre coordinates from the ''University Map'' link on yu.edu.jo/index.php/en/yu-maps (32.535930, 35.859444). Wikipedia gives 32.5375, 35.85556. brand_color is null: Wikipedia lists the colours as green and white, but no official hex value was found. ''منصة اّبسول'' is linked on the homepage, but its purpose was not confirmed; it uses a Moodle-style /login/index.php path.')
